### Create a new contact - Local
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Ashley",
    "lastName": "Weaver",
    "email": "ashley@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "blue",
    "birthday": "1995-06-15"
}

### Update a contact - Local
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/6ac18b0ce20ff2c9489887b0
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Ashley",
    "lastName": "Weaver",
    "email": "ashley.updated@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "yellow",
    "birthday": "1995-07-20"
}

### Delete a contact - Local
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/6ac18b0ce20ff2c9489887b0